OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start this morning with
OL,6,Fsome early brightness, especially in
OL,7,Fthe south. Cloud and showery rain will
OL,8,Fspread southwards though through the
OL,9,Fday, before turning brighter again
OL,10,Flater from the north. Temperatures a
OL,11,Flittle below average for August.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers easing this evening,
OL,14,Falthough may linger until the small
OL,15,Fhours near the coast. Clearing skies
OL,16,Fwill lead to a chilly night,
OL,17,Fespecially in the countryside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
