OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry and bright day with a
OL,6,Fmix of sunny spells and fair weather
OL,7,Fcloud. After a cool start,
OL,8,Ftemperatures climbing to around
OL,9,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,12,FRemaining largely dry with sunny
OL,13,Fspells on Sunday and Monday. Showers
OL,14,Fand possibly thunderstorms developing
OL,15,Fon Tuesday. Feeling warmer, especially
OL,16,Fin the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
